ef=\"?note=433e9516a72135ee\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md\">58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}semi\\text{-}generic\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S\n(p,M,W,\\theta,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(M)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\exists H,1_{\\mathbb P},\\check\\omega_1\\in W\\;\\Bigl[\nH=\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S((M,\\in),(H,\\in),\\{\\in\\})\\land\n\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\omega_1,\\omega_1,\\mathbb P)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\dot\\alpha\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot\\alpha,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(W,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_\\in,\n\\langle\\dot\\alpha,\\check\\omega_1\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\beta\\in M\\cap\\omega_1\\;\\exists\\check\\beta\\in W\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\beta,\\beta,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(W,p,\\varphi_=,\n\\langle\\dot\\alpha,\\check\\beta\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing10\\text{-}semi\\text{-}generic\\text{-}condition} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing10SemiGenericCondition}_S\n(p,M,W,\\theta,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\land\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\omega_1&lt;\\theta\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(M)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\exists H,1_{\\mathbb P},\\check\\omega_1\\in W\\;\\Bigl[\nH=\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\theta)\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S((M,\\in),(H,\\in),\\{\\in\\})\\land\n\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},1_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land p\\in\\mathbb P\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\omega_1,\\omega_1,\\mathbb P)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\dot\\alpha\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot\\alpha,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(W,1_{\\mathbb P},\\varphi_\\in,\n\\langle\\dot\\alpha,\\check\\omega_1\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists\\beta\\in M\\cap\\omega_1\\;\\exists\\check\\beta\\in W\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\beta,\\beta,\\mathbb P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(W,p,\\varphi_=,\n\\langle\\dot\\alpha,\\check\\beta\\rangle,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set ground model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> is explicit, so every forcing assertion uses the canonical six-argument relation instead of an ambient-class abbreviation.</li>\n<li>The model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\prec H_\\theta\">\\(M\\prec H_\\theta\\)</span> is countable and contains the forcing. A condition is semigeneric exactly when every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-name forced to lie below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> is decided by it to a canonical name from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\cap\\omega_1\">\\(M\\cap\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":fal